{"id":"0173cc4dcb83ade5","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-jonsson-variety.md","title":"Jonsson Variety","display":"Jonsson Variety","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-jonsson-variety","aliases":["93-prop-jonsson-variety"],"display":"Jonsson Variety","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","[[93-df-jonsson-chain]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-jonsson-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-jonsson-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Jonsson Variety"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e317109be82f65fa\" href=\"?note=e317109be82f65fa\" title=\"93-df-congruence-distributive\">93-df-congruence-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8026e52a7730811\" href=\"?note=c8026e52a7730811\" title=\"93-df-jonsson-chain\">93-df-jonsson-chain</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-jonsson-variety-—-Jónsson-Variety\">prop-jonsson-variety — Jónsson Variety</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> is a class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e317109be82f65fa\" href=\"?note=e317109be82f65fa\" title=\"93-df-congruence-distributive\">93-df-congruence-distributive</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8026e52a7730811\" href=\"?note=c8026e52a7730811\" title=\"93-df-jonsson-chain\">93-df-jonsson-chain</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\bar d\\;\n\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}(\\bar d,n,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\bar d\\;\n\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}(\\bar d,n,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Jónsson terms characterize congruence distributivity. Congruence extension and bounded cardinality of all subdirectly irreducible members are not part of this equivalence.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-jonsson-variety-—-Jónsson-Variety","text":"prop-jonsson-variety — Jónsson Variety","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"e317109be82f65fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-jonsson-chain","status":"resolved","id":"c8026e52a7730811","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-jonsson-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"e317109be82f65fa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-congruence-distributive]] and [[93-df-jonsson-chain]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-jonsson-chain","status":"resolved","id":"c8026e52a7730811","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-congruence-distributive]] and [[93-df-jonsson-chain]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists\\bar d\\;\n\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}(\\bar d,n,\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":true}],"bytes":1061,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d","e317109be82f65fa","c8026e52a7730811"]}